#, no-wrap
msgid "Session Goal"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/goal.md:8
msgid ""
"Session Goal lets you set a persistent objective for a single conversation. "
"After each turn, an independent **judge model** decides whether the goal is "
"complete; if not, a continuation prompt is injected automatically until the "
"goal is met, the turn budget is exhausted, or the user pauses/clears."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/goal.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commands"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/goal.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command                | Description                                           |\n"
"| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `/goal <description>`  | Set goal and start first run (default 20-turn budget) |\n"
"| `/goal status`         | View goal, subgoals, turn count, judge reason         |\n"
"| `/goal pause`          | Pause auto-continuation (keep goal state)             |\n"
"| `/goal resume`         | Resume auto-continuation                              |\n"
"| `/goal clear`          | Clear goal                                            |\n"
"| `/subgoal`             | List subgoals                                         |\n"
"| `/subgoal <condition>` | Append sub-condition                                  |\n"
"| `/subgoal remove <N>`  | Remove subgoal N (1-based)                            |\n"
"| `/subgoal clear`       | Clear all subgoals                                    |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/goal.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "On **Chat**, terminal commands (`/goal status`, pause/resume/clear, `/subgoal` list, etc.) run via Habitat RPC `conversation.command` and show in a result panel or toast — they do not flash through the message stream. Setting a goal (`/goal <description>`) and `/retry` still use `message.send` so the LLM turn streams into the conversation. Discord/Weixin keep the existing slash → stream reply path.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/goal.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:33
msgid ""
"User runs `/goal …` → writes `conversations.goal` and triggers engine run."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:33
msgid ""
"After each assistant reply → **goal judge** reads goal, subgoals, recent "
"dialogue, last reply."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:33
msgid "Judge outputs strict JSON: `{\"done\": boolean, \"reason\": \"...\"}`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:33
msgid ""
"`done: false` → inject user-role continuation (e.g. `↻ Continuing toward "
"goal (3/20): …`), continue next turn in same SSE stream."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:33
msgid "`done: true` → mark completed, stop continuation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:33
msgid ""
"User message mid-run preempts current continuation; after that turn, re-"
"judge; continues if not paused."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/goal.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Judge conservative policy"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:39
msgid ""
"**Pass**: assistant clearly confirms completion, shows final deliverable, or "
"states blocker needing user input (reason explains)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:39
msgid ""
"**Fail**: vague progress, plan only without evidence; implied completion "
"does not count."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:39
msgid ""
"**Judge unavailable**: call or parse failure **pauses** the goal (`status: "
"paused`), logs a warn, and appends a visible status line to the conversation "
"(not a continue prompt). Use `/goal resume` to retry. Check `/goal status` "
"for `last_judge_reason`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/goal.md:43
msgid ""
"Optional `goal_judge` in Habitat runtime `llm.profiles` (Shell **Settings → "
"Habitat 服务 → 服务配置**). Falls back to `llm.default_profile` when unset."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/goal.md:45
msgid ""
"Judge calls use OpenAI-compatible `response_format: json_object` and "
"`thinking: { type: \"disabled\" }` (via `params.extra`), plus "
"`maxOutputTokens: 2048`. Prefer a model/gateway that supports JSON mode; "
"unsupported endpoints will fail the judge call and pause the goal."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/goal.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "vs ACP"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:50
msgid ""
"**Goal**: in-conversation synchronous continuation loop; orchestrated by "
"platform turn lifecycle."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/goal.md:50
msgid ""
"**ACP**: external agent async task; callback triggers separate turn on "
"completion."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/goal.md:51
msgid "See [`architecture.md`](../product/architecture.md#session-goal)."
msgstr ""
